      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be great, especially in a space like VRChat where people (especially those who are LGBTQIA+ or curious in general) explore their identity.\n\nI always felt the 3 month cool down was a bit too long. I've also seen people stuck with a deadname due to it which isn't great.\n\nPlus it would be amazing for role play and the things you mentioned.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
